  "prefLabel": "Mtec 302.04 Fees, Form of Payment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 302.04 Fees, Form of Payment. Whenever an applicant makes payment to the board for satisfaction of a fee, the following shall apply:\n\n(a) Payment shall be made in the form of cash, check, or money order;\n\n(b) Checks and money orders shall be made payable to \"Treasurer, State of New Hampshire \"; and\n\n(c) Unless otherwise provided in these rules, any fee prescribed by statute or rule shall be submitted at the same time as the application.\n\nSource. #11091-B, eff 5-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mtec300.html"
